                                "sense_id": "6258d4ac-09cb-347d-8745-a267d79110e1",
                                "text": "Spring-headed Hydraes, and sea-shouldring Whales, / Great whirlpooles, which all fishes make to flee, / Bright Scolopendraes, arm'd with siluer scales, / Mighty Monoceroses, with immeasured tayles."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
